@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `nii-il33-nouns`
IMPORT `nii-il33-readings`
IMPORT `nii-schedule-a1-ages`
IMPORT `nii-s2a-residence`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Maintenance (Assurance of Payment) Law, 5732-1972 (חוק המזונות (הבטחת תשלום)): the gate to a monthly payment.
-- Row IL-33.
-- Source: ../../../maintenance-assurance-of-payment-law-5732-1972/registers/source-bundle/maintenance-assurance-of-payment-law-5732-1972.he.wiki.txt
-- (Hebrew Wikisource raw wikitext). Every `src:N` comment in this module quotes line N of THAT file.
--
-- WHAT IT IS FOR. s 68(c) of the National Insurance Law adds a supplement to the child allowance of a parent
-- paid a monthly payment under this Law for a month. Row IL-06 takes that fact as an input. This module says
-- when such a payment is made for a month, as far as the Law's gate goes: s 1 (who is a creditor), s 2(a)
-- (entitled to ask), s 3 (the rate), s 6(a) (the period), s 9 (no payment to one pursuing enforcement),
-- s 9A (absence abroad).
--
-- NOT ENCODED (NOTES.md): the regulations that fix the rates (s 3, s 20), the application and the notice (ss 4,
-- 5), ss 7, 8, 10 to 23; s 9A(c)(2) (payment to the exempt, on rules the Minister of Justice fixes) is refused
-- by name. "Resident" is the Insurance Law's: s 2(b) of this Law says so ("מי שהוא תושב לענין חוק הביטוח הלאומי").
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Maintenance Law — whether a monthly payment is made for a month`

§§ `Section 1: a creditor, and section 2(a): the right to ask`

-- src:27 | ”זוכה“ – מי שפסק דין למזונות ניתן לזכותו ואינו מתגורר עם החייב, לרבות הורה שאינו מתגורר עם החייב שפסק דין למזונות ניתן לזכות ילדו הקטין הנמצא בהחזקתו אף אם אינו עמו;
-- "זוכה" – one in whose favour a maintenance judgment was given and who does not live with the debtor,
-- including a parent not living with the debtor in whose favour a judgment was given for the minor child in his
-- keeping, even if the child is not with him.
@ref ML s 1 "זוכה", line 27
GIVEN f IS A `The facts of a maintenance creditor`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ML s 1 — a creditor:` f MEANS
        NOT (f's `lives with the debtor`)
    AND (   f's `a maintenance judgment was given in the person's favour`
         OR f's `a maintenance judgment was given in favour of the person's minor child in the person's keeping`)

-- src:36 | (א) זוכה שהוא תושב ישראל, זכאי לבקש מאת המוסד תשלום חדשי לפי הוראות חוק זה, ובלבד שהחייב היה תושב ישראל ביום מתן פסק הדין למזונות או במשך עשרים וארבעה חודשים לפחות מתוך ארבעים ושמונת החודשים שקדמו בתכוף ליום מתן פסק הדין למזונות.
-- src:39 | ”תושב ישראל“ – מי שהוא תושב לענין חוק הביטוח הלאומי, לרבות תושב ישראל באזור כהגדרתו בסעיף 378 לחוק האמור.
-- s 2(a): a creditor who is a resident may ask the Institute for a monthly payment, provided the debtor was an
-- Israeli resident on the day of the judgment or for at least 24 of the 48 months before it. "Resident": s 2(b),
-- as for the Insurance Law, including a resident of the Area (s 378).
@ref ML s 2(a), (b), lines 36, 39
GIVEN p         IS A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      f         IS A `The facts of a maintenance creditor`
      `the day` IS A DATE
      rd        IS A `The readings this row takes where the text does not decide`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ML s 2 — entitled to ask for a monthly payment:` p `with` f `, on` `the day` `, reading` rd MEANS
        `ML s 1 — a creditor:` f
    AND (   f's `the debtor was an Israeli resident on the day of the judgment`
         OR f's `the debtor was an Israeli resident for at least 24 of the 48 months before the day of the judgment`)
    AND (   f's `a resident of Israel in the Area within section 378 of the Insurance Law`
         OR `s 2A — an Israeli resident:` p `on` `the day` `, reading 183 as` (rd's `exactly 183 days in section 2A`))

§§ `Section 3: the rate`

-- src:42 | שיעורי התשלום הם כפי שנקבעו בפסק הדין למזונות או בתקנות, הכל לפי השיעור הקטן יותר.
-- "שיעורי התשלום הם כפי שנקבעו בפסק הדין למזונות או בתקנות, הכל לפי השיעור הקטן יותר": the rate is the lesser of
-- what the judgment fixed and what the regulations fix. The regulations are not deposited: the rate they fix is an
-- input, and without it the rate is refused by name.
@ref ML s 3, line 42
GIVEN f IS A `The facts of a maintenance creditor`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`ML s 3 — the monthly payment rate:` f MEANS
    CONSIDER f's `the monthly rate the regulations fix, if they are given`
    WHEN JUST rate THEN min rate (f's `the monthly maintenance the judgment orders`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN
        REFUSE "section 3 pays the lesser of the rate the maintenance judgment fixes and the rate the regulations fix, and the regulations under the Maintenance (Assurance of Payment) Law are not deposited: needs a source"

§§ `Section 6(a): the period`

-- src:52 | (א) תשלום לפי חוק זה ישולם לזוכה במשך התקופה הקבועה בפסק הדין למזונות, כל עוד מוטלת על החייב חובה בתשלום המזונות, אולם לא ישולם למפרע אלא עד היום שנקבע בפסק הדין או עד שנה אחת לפני יום הגשת הבקשה למוסד, הכל לפי המאוחר.
-- "תשלום לפי חוק זה ישולם לזוכה במשך התקופה הקבועה בפסק הדין למזונות, כל עוד מוטלת על החייב חובה בתשלום
-- המזונות, אולם לא ישולם למפרע אלא עד היום שנקבע בפסק הדין או עד שנה אחת לפני יום הגשת הבקשה למוסד, הכל
-- לפי המאוחר": payment for the period the judgment fixes; not retroactively except back to the day the judgment
-- sets or one year before the request, whichever is LATER. A month in which the period begins or ends partway
-- is fork M1 (nouns): the Law pays by the month and does not say.
@ref ML s 6(a), line 52; fork M1
GIVEN f IS A `The facts of a maintenance creditor`
GIVETH A DATE
`ML s 6(a) — the first day payment can be made for:` f MEANS
    IF   judgmentStarts AT LEAST yearBeforeRequest
    THEN judgmentStarts
    ELSE yearBeforeRequest
    WHERE
        judgmentStarts    MEANS f's `the day from which the judgment orders maintenance`
        yearBeforeRequest MEANS `add years` (f's `the day the request for payment was submitted to the Institute`) (0 MINUS 1)

@ref ML s 6(a), line 52; fork M1
GIVEN `the first day of the month` IS A DATE
      f           IS A `The facts of a maintenance creditor`
      rd          IS A `The readings this row takes where the text does not decide`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ML s 6(a) — the month beginning` `the first day of the month` `is within the period of payment of` f `, reading` rd MEANS
    IF   beforeStart OR afterEnd
    THEN FALSE
    ELSE IF   beginsPartway OR endsPartway
         THEN CONSIDER rd's `a month in which the period of payment begins or ends partway`
              WHEN `a month in which the period begins or ends partway is paid in full` THEN TRUE
              WHEN `a month in which the period begins or ends partway is not paid` THEN FALSE
              WHEN `a month in which the period begins or ends partway is declined where the two readings differ` THEN
                  REFUSE "section 6(a) pays by the period the judgment fixes and does not say how a month is paid in which that period begins or ends partway"
         ELSE TRUE
    WHERE
        last          MEANS (`add months` `the first day of the month` 1) MINUS 1
        start         MEANS `ML s 6(a) — the first day payment can be made for:` f
        endDay        MEANS f's `the day to which the judgment orders maintenance, if it names one`
        beforeStart   MEANS last LESS THAN start
        beginsPartway MEANS start GREATER THAN `the first day of the month` AND start AT MOST last
        afterEnd      MEANS
            CONSIDER endDay
            WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
            WHEN JUST e THEN e LESS THAN `the first day of the month`
        endsPartway   MEANS
            CONSIDER endDay
            WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
            WHEN JUST e THEN e AT LEAST `the first day of the month` AND e LESS THAN last

§§ `Section 9: enforcement`

-- src:66 | (א) התשלומים ישולמו לזוכה שאינו נוקט בהליכים לביצוע פסק הדין למזונות.
-- src:67 | (ב) נקט הזוכה בהליכי ביצוע לפני שהגיש בקשה למוסד, רשאי הוא להפסיקם ולהגיש בקשה לפי חוק זה.
-- src:68 | (ג) נקט הזוכה הליכי ביצוע לאחר שהגיש בקשה למוסד, ייפסקו זכויותיו לתשלומים מאת המוסד.
-- src:69 | (ד) שר המשפטים רשאי לקבוע בתקנות מקרים ותנאים שבהם לא ייפסקו זכויותיו של הזוכה לתשלומים על אף האמור בסעיף קטן (ג).
-- (a) payments are made to a creditor who does not take enforcement proceedings on the judgment; (b) one who took
-- them before applying may stop them and apply; (c) one who took them after applying loses the right to payments;
-- (d) the Minister of Justice may fix cases in which the rights do not cease. One flag says whether the creditor
-- is now pursuing enforcement; the regulations' exceptions are another flag.
@ref ML s 9, lines 66-69
GIVEN f IS A `The facts of a maintenance creditor`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ML s 9 — barred by pursuing enforcement:` f MEANS
    f's `is pursuing enforcement proceedings on the judgment` AND NOT (f's `the Minister of Justice's regulations let payment continue despite enforcement, section 9(d)`)

§§ `Section 9A: absence abroad`

-- src:73 | (ב) לא ישולם תשלום לזוכה שיצא את ישראל אם מתקיים האמור בפסקאות (1) או (2) שלהלן – בעד התקופות המפורטות בהן:
-- src:74 | (1) הזוכה יצא את ישראל ארבע פעמים או יותר באותה שנה קלנדרית – בעד חודש היציאה הקלנדרי ובעד חודש השיבה הקלנדרי וכן בעד חודש קלנדרי שבו שהה, בכל ימי החודש, מחוץ לישראל, והכל מהפעם הרביעית שבה יצא את ישראל ואילך;
-- src:75 | (2) הזוכה יצא את ישראל פחות מארבע פעמים באותה שנה קלנדרית, ואולם סך הימים שבהם שהה מחוץ לישראל באותה שנה קלנדרית עלה על 72 ימים – בעד כל אחד מהחודשים שבהם תקופת שהייתו מחוץ לישראל עלתה על 72 הימים האמורים.
-- src:80 | (ד)(1) שהה זוכה מחוץ לישראל 183 ימים לפחות במהלך 12 חודשים רצופים, יראו אותו כמי שנמצא מחוץ לישראל כל עוד לא תמו 12 חודשים רצופים שבהם שהה בישראל 183 ימים לפחות.
-- (b)(1) four or more departures in a calendar year: nothing for the month of the departure, the month of the
-- return and a month wholly abroad, from the fourth departure on; (b)(2) fewer than four departures and more than
-- 72 days abroad in the year: nothing for each month in which the stay abroad exceeded the 72 days -- taken as each
-- month with a day abroad in which the year's days abroad, to its end, exceed 72; (c) exemptions: payment then
-- follows rules the Minister of Justice fixes, which are not deposited; (d)(1) a creditor with 183 days or more abroad
-- in 12 consecutive months is treated as outside Israel: taken here as not paid (the 183 days are over 72, and the
-- departures of (b)(1) are the case's).
@ref ML s 9A(b), (c), (d), lines 73-83
GIVEN a IS A `The absences of a maintenance creditor in a month`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ML s 9A — not paid for the month because of absence abroad:` a MEANS
    IF   a's `exempt under section 9A(c)`
    THEN REFUSE "section 9A(c)(2) pays a creditor exempted by (c) according to rules, conditions and a period the Minister of Justice fixes, and those rules are not deposited: needs a source"
    ELSE    a's `treated as outside Israel under section 9A(d)`
         OR (    (a's `departures from Israel in the calendar year, up to and including the month`) AT LEAST 4
             AND a's `the month contains a departure after the third, a return after the third, or only days abroad`)
         OR (    (a's `departures from Israel in the calendar year, up to and including the month`) LESS THAN 4
             AND (a's `days abroad in the calendar year, up to the end of the month`) GREATER THAN 72
             AND (a's `days abroad in the month`) GREATER THAN 0)

§§ `A monthly payment is made for the month`

@ref ML s 1, 2(a), 3, 6(a), 9, 9A
GIVEN `the first day of the month` IS A DATE
      p         IS A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      f         IS A `The facts of a maintenance creditor`
      a         IS A `The absences of a maintenance creditor in a month`
      rd        IS A `The readings this row takes where the text does not decide`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ML — a monthly payment is made for the month beginning` `the first day of the month` `to` p `with` f `and` a `, reading` rd MEANS
        `ML s 2 — entitled to ask for a monthly payment:` p `with` f `, on` `the first day of the month` `, reading` rd
    AND NOT `ML s 9 — barred by pursuing enforcement:` f
    AND `ML s 6(a) — the month beginning` `the first day of the month` `is within the period of payment of` f `, reading` rd
    AND NOT `ML s 9A — not paid for the month because of absence abroad:` a

@ref ML s 1, 2(a), 3, 6(a), 9, 9A; the ruling of 2026-10-08 (SHRUG)
GIVEN `the first day of the month` IS A DATE
      p         IS A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      f         IS A `The facts of a maintenance creditor`
      a         IS A `The absences of a maintenance creditor in a month`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ML — a monthly payment is made for the month beginning` `the first day of the month` `to` p `with` f `and` a MEANS
    `ML — a monthly payment is made for the month beginning` `the first day of the month` `to` p `with` f `and` a `, reading` `the readings this row takes`
